<%# The in-space contract detail page (civora-org/civora-platform#89): the
    standalone catalogue's detail view, rendered as is. One view stack for
    both surfaces, so the in-space page can never drift from the public one
    (published amendments, documents, provenance, linked results). The
    controller sets the same @contract and @amendments; the shared view
    routes its only standalone-only link (the supplier page) through a
    helper that degrades to plain text when the route is absent. %>
<%= render template: "decidim/contracts_sk/contracts/show" %>
